# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day37

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| evident | 명백한, 분명한 | It is evident that climate affects ecosystems. |
| establish | 확립하다, 설립하다 | The researchers established a new method. |
| significant | 중요한, 상당한 | The study found a significant difference. |

---

## Synonyms

### evident
→ obvious / clear

### establish
→ create / set up

### significant
→ important / considerable

---

## Useful Collocations

it is evident that
→ ~라는 것이 명백하다

establish a relationship
→ 관계를 확립하다

establish a system
→ 시스템을 확립하다

significant difference
→ 상당한 차이

significant impact
→ 상당한 영향

significant increase
→ 상당한 증가

---

## Important Grammar

### It is evident that + 문장

It is evident that the climate is changing.

→ 기후가 변하고 있다는 것은 명백하다.

